# Production release of nonfinancial features

When a nonfinancial feature is complete and its tests and production build pass, release it through the linked Vercel project `garmon-pay` from `/Users/bishop/Desktop/GarmonPay`. Do not deploy from an isolated worktree.

Preserve newer Solana, Phantom, trading, and security changes. Keep `FINANCIAL_OPERATIONS_PAUSED` true. Do not enable payments, real earnings, withdrawals, or Mainnet trades. Do not apply unreviewed or destructive database migrations. Do not replace signed wallet identity with staging profiles.

If those limits would be broken, stop and report the blocker instead of publishing.
